ass=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/ca5358659bfa1a8aa8c6aeddec55f8d4.avif?t=1782417534\" width=1560 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >              In Early Access, you can assemble in two maps: a dream-like stylized classic museum room with natural elements and a high resolution scan of a Swedish King's Hall. The<strong> levels are either hand-crafted, designed by an artist from scratch or real-life scans embellished to suit our style. </strong>We are committed to creating environments that are perfectly aligned with our message and we want to honor the sculpture puzzles to the best of our ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/61f2e3cdc493036817e1a1a832ba7d23.avif?t=1782417534\" width=1560 height=179 /></span>                Every puzzle contains historical information about its date, artist and what it represents. We'd love to spark curiosity and have our players learn more about ancient cultures, their discoveries and significance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/ab6ae27801fea9f49dc7d382c62d88c8.avif?t=1782417534\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras_big/ab6ae27801fea9f49dc7d382c62d88c8.avif?t=1782417534 width=1560 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/f1fec1941deaa3c5212709fe3c0534cc.avif?t=1782417534\" width=1560 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Organizing Board</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces can be easily sort on the tray in an automatic grid, much as you would rearrange apps in your phone screen. Once there are too many empty slots, press the button on the top right to send all pieces to the top of the tray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/32b4eef58ac7671f31bc2c89e760a3c7.poster.avif?t=1782417534\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/32b4eef58ac7671f31bc2c89e760a3c7.webm?t=1782417534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/32b4eef58ac7671f31bc2c89e760a3c7.mp4?t=1782417534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hint System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too difficult? Use the sideview window, our <i>'hot and cold'</i> or the <i>'hint VFX'</i> options, accessible through the settings menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/b0d6db90cddf36fbb10be30b12ce9f0c.poster.avif?t=1782417534\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/b0d6db90cddf36fbb10be30b12ce9f0c.webm?t=1782417534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/b0d6db90cddf36fbb10be30b12ce9f0c.mp4?t=1782417534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Own Art Gallery (Future Addition)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated level to display and revisit all the sculptures you have completed. Show them with pride! <i>(concept image)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras/61f3b0e743f587f5ced45c521497ab6a.avif?t=1782417534\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/extras_big/61f3b0e743f587f5ced45c521497ab6a.avif?t=1782417534 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monthly Content Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free and paid levels and sculpture puzzles added every month. Keep building for as long as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our team is dedicated to world building. Ancient inspired music meticulously composed and recorded blends antique instruments with modern techniques, achieving a perfect balance between emotional and calming in each track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Assemble 3D jigsaw puzzles of real museum artifacts. Each piece reveals the history behind humanity's masterpieces. A relaxing puzzle game for art lovers.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/6e9142daca8cb24cea32d68564113e9fa1328e2f/header.jpg?t=1782417534", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/9031fb9f68002505dbea9c8d3faf13ad342543ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782417534", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897520/9031fb9f68002505dbea9c8d3faf13ad342543ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782417534", "website": "https://pazlstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS